  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Beginning with Zscaler Client Connector-integrated Agent 6.1, landmine validates certain file paths specified in policies before creating or managing path-based lures and decoys. Paths that target the OS, security, credential, or other protected locations are rejected. The blocked paths vary depending on the endpoint OS."
    },
    {
      "text": "The following sections list the blocked paths for each OS."
    },
    {
      "item": "Windows",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Path validation is case insensitive and uses the actual Windows and system directories configured on the endpoint.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The following locations are blocked:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Windows installation directory, typically C:\\Windows, including System32, SysWOW64, WinSxS, and other subdirectories",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<SystemDrive>\\Boot",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<SystemDrive>\\System Volume Information",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<ProgramData>\\Microsoft\\Crypto",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<ProgramData>\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<ProgramData>\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Hyper-V",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The all-users Startup folder, typically C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\StartUp",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The following user-specific locations are also blocked:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\Microsoft\\Protect\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Credentials\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Vault\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\WindowsApps\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\Microsoft\\Templates\\",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\NTUSER.DAT",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "<drive>:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Windows\\UsrClass.dat",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
